questionText:
A C program is written to take three integers with different values as an input and also identify the largest number amongst them.
Write the missing code in the given box to achieve the mentioned task.

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
  int n1, n2, n3;
  printf("Enter three different numbers: \n");
  scanf("%d %d %d", &n1, &n2, &n3);

  /* Write missing conditional code here */

  return 0;
}
```

modelAnswer:
**Missing Conditional Code (C Language):**
```c
if ((n1 > n2) && (n1 > n3))
    printf("Largest number is: %d", n1);
else if ((n2 > n1) && (n2 > n3))
    printf("Largest number is: %d", n2);
else
    printf("Largest number is: %d", n3);
```

**2025 Syllabus Equivalent (JavaScript):**
```javascript
if ((n1 > n2) && (n1 > n3)) {
    document.write("Largest number is: " + n1);
} else if ((n2 > n1) && (n2 > n3)) {
    document.write("Largest number is: " + n2);
} else {
    document.write("Largest number is: " + n3);
}
```

